==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|heim||home, homewards|lang=non}}, the accusative form of {{term|heimr||abode, world, land|lang=non}}.

===Adverb===
{{infl|is|adverb}}
# [[home]]

====Derived terms====
* [[fara heim]] (to go home)
* [[bjóða heim|bjóða einhverjum heim]] (to invite somebody home)
* [[sækja heim]] (to visit, ''confer'' '''[[heimsækja]]''')
* [[það kemur heim og saman]] (that is correct)

